ipment overlaid in your physical space, guided step-by-step with hand tracking and speech recognition for patient communication.\n\n**Features**:\n\n- 23 CNA skills covering patient care procedures\n- Hand tracking and controller support\n- Speech recognition for patient communication steps\n- Automated skill demonstrations\n- Progress saving and session tracking\n- Easy access via QR code or token\n- Passthrough; train in your own environment\n\nDesigned for nursing education programs to supplement hands-on clinical training.", "short_description": "Practice Certified Nursing Assistant(CNA)  skills in XR. Step-by-step guided procedures with hand tracking and speech recognition."}]}, "developer_name": "ExamRoom.AI", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://credentia.com/about-us/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://credentia.com/about-us/terms-and-conditions/", "publisher_name": "ExamRoom.AI", "support_website_url": "https://help.credentia.com/en", "website_url": "https://credentia.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1154762497722594"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1021792543766640"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1021792543766640"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1783518420, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1021792543766640"}]}, "liveCha